        "collapsible_tab_BwtdyK": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Built around a contoured cut-out seat, ErgoRelief™ works with your body to<br/>take pressure off your tailbone and hips — the exact spot that starts hurting<br/>20-30 minutes into a desk day. It’s the difference between a cushion that just<br/>feels soft and one that actually changes how you sit.</p><p><strong>What's included:</strong></p><p>● ErgoRelief™ Seat Cushion — ergonomic cut-out design, memory foam with breathable mesh, removable washable zip cover, non-slip base and universal fit.</p><p>● The SitComfort 7-Day Reset Program (guided)</p><p>• Backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee</p><p><em>Designed in Australia for people who sit 6+ hours a day and are done compromising on comfort.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_fri6mY": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7-Day Reset Program",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>It's the difference between a cushion that feels good for a day and a system that fixes how you sit for good.</p><p>The 7-Day Reset Program is a guided, day-by-day plan included with every ErgoRelief™. Each day takes a few minutes and builds on the last — small posture cues, stretches, and setup adjustments that retrain your body to sit better, not just softer.</p><p><strong>How it works:</strong></p><p>● Day-by-day guidance delivered straight to your inbox — no app, no login, no fuss</p><p>● Simple, physio-informed movements and posture checks you can do at your desk</p><p>● Built to work alongside your ErgoRelief™ and LumbarEase™ set-up</p><p>● Takes 2–3 minutes a day</p><p>By Day 7, you're not just sitting on a better cushion — you're sitting better, period. That's the difference between temporary relief and a lasting fix.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wp4qfc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong></p><p>● Express shipping, all orders, all of Australia</p><p>● Dispatched from our Sydney warehouse — no overseas wait times</p><p>● Tracking sent straight to your inbox the moment it ships</p><p><strong>Returns</strong></p><p>● 30-day money-back guarantee — if it's not right for you, it's not right for us</p><p>● Easy returns, no hoops to jump through</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
