            "question": "Shipping & returns?",
            "answer": "We offer fast and reliable shipping across Australia, with tracking provided once your order is dispatched.\n\nIf you’re not completely satisfied, you can return your order within the return period for a refund or exchange — as long as the product is in good condition.\n\nFor any questions or assistance, simply contact us at info@sitcomfort.com.au and our team will be happy to help."
